BBUUGGSS
     Limiting mmeemmoorryyuussee may kill the machine due to thrashing.

     The rreeaaddiiooppss and wwrriitteeiiooppss counters are only approximations.  Like
     rreeaaddbbppss and wwrriitteebbppss, they are calculated in the filesystem layer, where
     it is difficult or even impossible to observe actual disk device opera‐
     tions.

     The wwrriitteebbppss and wwrriitteeiiooppss resources generally account for writes to the
     filesystem cache, not to actual devices.

